│     │  Ctrl+J opens Sampler view   Esc returns to Pattern view                                                 █- ---│
│     │  In Sampler view: +/- zoom waveform   Left/Right pan   Home/End bounds                                   █- ---│
│     │  Tab/Shift+Tab selects A/D/S/R   [/]/{/} adjusts selected envelope field                                 █- ---│
│     │  :sample view PATH loads a WAV and shows metadata plus waveform                                          █- ---│
│     │  :sample browse [DIR] opens the in-app sample browser                                                    █- ---│
│     │  :sample choose [DIR] opens the configured external chooser                                              █- ---│
│     │                                                                                                          █- ---│
│     │Track Assignment                                                                                          █- ---│
│     │  :sample assign [TRACK] assigns the loaded sample to a track                                             █- ---│
│     │  :sample replace [TRACK] swaps the track sample and prunes the old reference                             █- ---│
│     │  :sample unassign [TRACK] clears the track sample and instrument assignment                              ║- ---│
│     │  TRACK is 1-based; omitted TRACK means the current track                                                 ║- ---│
│     │  :sample assignments lists track=sample mappings                                                         ║- ---│
└─────│                                                                                                          ║- ---│
┌ Song│Instrument Column                                                                                         ║- ---│
│  00 │  Assigning a sample creates a sample-backed instrument for that track                                    ║- ---│
